  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Three blocks <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>B</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> are pulled on a horizontal smooth surface by a force of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>80</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> as shown in figure. The tensions <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo> </mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo> </mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> in the string are respectively:</p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/3b8fc467-94df-41ea-aabf-4b4aa711658e.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 56px;\"/>",
    "image": null
  },
