  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Since, the length of the string will remain same. Hence, all blocks will have the same acceleration.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>F</mi><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>80</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/82ff935b-17b5-4954-8353-f29f517d571a.png\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 72px;\"/></p><p>Therefore, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>.</p><p>Now,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/8f1a718b-a8e0-41b2-bfb1-1b401caca5a3.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 70px;\"/></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
  },
